WEBVTT

00:01:38.311 --> 00:01:40.447
Ryoko, huh?

00:01:40.447 --> 00:01:43.884
We haven't heard about
her much lately, have we?

00:01:43.884 --> 00:01:45.352
Like you didn't know?

00:01:45.352 --> 00:01:48.989
I heard that she settled down on planet Earth.

00:01:48.989 --> 00:01:51.558
Earth? Where the hell is that?

00:01:51.558 --> 00:01:56.863
Well, I don't know exactly, but they
say it's out in the middle of nowhere.

00:01:56.863 --> 00:01:59.599
I heard that she's living with some guy.

00:01:59.599 --> 00:02:03.035
Hmmmph! Ryoko is a woman, after all.

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:06.334
Wh-Who are you?

00:02:07.607 --> 00:02:10.777
Having a reunion of the wanted, huh?

00:02:10.777 --> 00:02:12.267
Bounty hunter?

00:02:32.466 --> 00:02:33.767
Don't worry.

00:02:33.767 --> 00:02:35.769
I'm not interested in you at all.

00:02:35.769 --> 00:02:38.795
Y-You can't be that...

00:02:39.573 --> 00:02:43.475
Tell me more of what you know about Ryoko.

00:03:01.328 --> 00:03:05.198
Ryo-Ohki will be very
happy with this many carrots.

00:03:05.198 --> 00:03:07.067
Huh?

00:03:07.067 --> 00:03:09.202
It must be Ryo-Ohki.

00:03:09.202 --> 00:03:11.932
Calm down. These are all for you.

00:03:13.907 --> 00:03:15.636
Ryo-Ohki?

00:03:17.344 --> 00:03:19.107
You are...

00:03:32.425 --> 00:03:33.983
Ryoko!

00:03:36.263 --> 00:03:37.958
Ryoko!

00:03:38.632 --> 00:03:40.767
Where is Ryoko?

00:03:40.767 --> 00:03:43.136
Well...

00:03:43.136 --> 00:03:44.571
Now tell me the truth!

00:03:44.571 --> 00:03:47.369
You'll regret it if you try to hide anything.

00:03:51.645 --> 00:03:56.983
Sorry. Everybody told
me to stay for snacks,

00:03:56.983 --> 00:04:01.988
- so I wasn't eating your share or anything.
- I was not asking you about snacks.

00:04:01.988 --> 00:04:04.291
She hasn't been around for a while.

00:04:04.291 --> 00:04:05.225
What's the matter?

00:04:05.225 --> 00:04:07.260
I cannot find Tenchi!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:07.861
What?

00:04:07.861 --> 00:04:10.997
I thought you were looking
for Ryoko, weren't you?

00:04:10.997 --> 00:04:14.768
What I am saying is that Ryoko
must have taken Tenchi with her

00:04:14.768 --> 00:04:17.931
to some indecent place!

00:04:19.072 --> 00:04:21.975
Ryoko! Ryoko! Where did you go?

00:04:21.975 --> 00:04:24.910
- Difficult, isn't she, Sasami?
- You cannot hide from me.

00:04:26.513 --> 00:04:30.417
She's getting worse
these days, don't you think?

00:04:30.417 --> 00:04:32.214
Yup, definitely.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.281
What's wrong, Ryo-Ohki?

00:04:43.163 --> 00:04:44.531
There's something up there!

00:04:44.531 --> 00:04:46.866
Eek! Can it be a rat?

00:04:46.866 --> 00:04:49.703
A rat can't be that big!

00:04:49.703 --> 00:04:51.637
Is it a cat, then?

00:04:56.876 --> 00:04:59.045
- Wow!
- Wow, how cute!

00:04:59.045 --> 00:05:00.914
He looks exactly like Ryo-Ohki!

00:05:00.914 --> 00:05:02.882
How did he get in here?

00:05:02.882 --> 00:05:05.350
Is he a friend of Ryo-Ohki?

00:05:07.153 --> 00:05:08.814
Ryo-Ohki?

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:12.025
What's the problem, you two?

00:05:12.025 --> 00:05:14.255
Hey, Ryo-Ohki!

00:05:16.363 --> 00:05:18.763
You shouldn't be so hostile.

00:05:20.433 --> 00:05:24.237
Try to get along, or I won't
give you any more carrots.

00:05:24.237 --> 00:05:27.607
You can be friendly to that newcomer, right?

00:05:27.607 --> 00:05:30.310
That's my boy.

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:32.946
I've got some for you, too.

00:05:32.946 --> 00:05:35.972
There. You two eat together, okay?

00:05:38.184 --> 00:05:41.121
He doesn't seem to like carrots.

00:05:41.121 --> 00:05:43.657
They are really good.

00:05:43.657 --> 00:05:46.455
Here. Try some.

00:05:56.202 --> 00:05:57.804
He ate it.

00:05:57.804 --> 00:06:01.574
They are the same kind, all right.

00:06:01.574 --> 00:06:05.305
Here. Have some more.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:13.153
They are so crazy about them.

00:06:13.153 --> 00:06:14.916
Good for them.

00:06:16.256 --> 00:06:19.453
Who does he belong to, though?

00:06:26.733 --> 00:06:29.569
He's so sweet, huh?

00:06:29.569 --> 00:06:32.038
He must have been brought up well.

00:06:32.038 --> 00:06:34.374
You must be happy, Ryo-Ohki.

00:06:34.374 --> 00:06:36.676
Ahh, that was a nice bath.

00:06:36.676 --> 00:06:40.237
Lounging and taking a bath
in daytime feels especially good.

00:06:43.149 --> 00:06:44.951
K-Ken-Ohki!

00:06:44.951 --> 00:06:46.486
Ken-Ohki?

00:06:46.486 --> 00:06:48.288
Do you know him, Ryoko?

00:06:48.288 --> 00:06:51.024
Ken-Ohki? Is that his name?

00:06:51.024 --> 00:06:54.323
No way! She can't be here on Earth!

00:06:59.532 --> 00:07:01.234
Ken-Ohki!

00:07:01.234 --> 00:07:02.861
We've got to follow him!

00:07:11.711 --> 00:07:14.908
Wh-What in the world is going on?

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:22.322
What is happening?

00:07:22.322 --> 00:07:23.983
Ryoko?

00:07:35.635 --> 00:07:37.535
Just as I thought. It was you!

00:07:42.642 --> 00:07:45.304
Long time no see, Ryoko.

00:07:48.948 --> 00:07:52.577
I didn't think you'd come this far after me.

00:07:53.286 --> 00:07:56.489
That's what I do for a
living as a bounty hunter.

00:07:56.489 --> 00:08:00.360
I told you that I'd take your head.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.295
Nagi!

00:08:02.295 --> 00:08:05.031
You're a bounty hunter, Nagi, right?

00:08:05.031 --> 00:08:06.866
This is my jurisdiction!

00:08:06.866 --> 00:08:09.369
Bounty hunters should stay out of this area.

00:08:09.369 --> 00:08:10.970
Are you Kiyone?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.473
You've heard of me?

00:08:13.473 --> 00:08:17.544
They say you're the best among the
younger generation of Galaxy Police.

00:08:17.544 --> 00:08:19.412
Ohh.

00:08:19.412 --> 00:08:23.149
But now you're stationed
in this remote region.

00:08:23.149 --> 00:08:26.346
Rumor has it that you're down on your luck.

00:08:28.621 --> 00:08:33.059
Ugh. That's not my fault.
It's because of my partner here.

00:08:33.059 --> 00:08:38.190
Hmph. I wouldn't sink so low as
to blame others for my problems.

00:08:39.432 --> 00:08:42.168
Wait a second! What are you talking about?

00:08:42.168 --> 00:08:44.470
Kiyone isn't a loser.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:48.942
She's getting 200 yen more
per hour than me, you know!

00:08:48.942 --> 00:08:50.944
You keep your mouth shut.

00:08:50.944 --> 00:08:54.447
Ryoko! I have taken your man as a hostage.

00:08:54.447 --> 00:08:55.648
You mean Tenchi?

00:08:55.648 --> 00:08:59.552
If you want your man back, come to Venus.

00:08:59.552 --> 00:09:01.487
We'll settle the matter there.

00:09:01.487 --> 00:09:05.758
Hey, you! Tenchi is not Ryoko's man.

00:09:05.758 --> 00:09:08.461
Please understand the situation correctly.

00:09:08.461 --> 00:09:10.224
Ken-Ohki!

00:09:10.997 --> 00:09:12.021
What?

00:09:25.078 --> 00:09:27.376
I'll be waiting for you, Ryoko!

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:32.313
Hey, come back!

00:10:02.749 --> 00:10:04.341
Ryoko.

00:10:09.789 --> 00:10:13.927
I've told you that I will
get the reward for you.

00:10:13.927 --> 00:10:17.294
I'm not gonna let you go, not you, never.

00:10:18.231 --> 00:10:22.565
We are having some fun, eh, aren't we?

00:10:27.173 --> 00:10:30.843
Ryoko! I need some explanation here.

00:10:30.843 --> 00:10:32.478
I cannot stand it.

00:10:32.478 --> 00:10:35.682
Tenchi is your man?
That is not the true story at all.

00:10:35.682 --> 00:10:39.519
Ayeka, that's not what we
should be concerned about.

00:10:39.519 --> 00:10:43.421
What is that Nagi person anyway?

00:10:45.658 --> 00:10:48.061
Kiyone?

00:10:48.061 --> 00:10:50.363
She's Nagi, the bounty hunter.

00:10:50.363 --> 00:10:53.132
She's a lone wolf type of hunter, who
goes after wanted criminals for the reward

00:10:53.132 --> 00:10:57.437
and she is an excellent bounty
hunter... probably the best in the universe.

00:10:57.437 --> 00:11:01.541
And she's after Ryoko?

00:11:01.541 --> 00:11:06.012
Nagi and I go way back.

00:11:06.012 --> 00:11:08.071
We're sort of arch rivals.

00:11:12.952 --> 00:11:16.183
The hunted and the hunter.

00:11:17.623 --> 00:11:21.218
We've faced each other
many times in the past.

00:11:32.505 --> 00:11:34.769
You can't get away from me, Ryoko!

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:47.909
Of all those hunted down by
her nobody has ever survived...

00:11:50.123 --> 00:11:52.318
...except me.

00:11:59.432 --> 00:12:02.502
But this time...

00:12:02.502 --> 00:12:04.470
...I don't know what'll happen.

00:12:23.923 --> 00:12:27.051
This guy is Ryoko's.

00:12:35.234 --> 00:12:37.065
We're almost to Venus.

00:12:39.238 --> 00:12:41.474
There she is!

00:12:41.474 --> 00:12:44.811
This is just between her and me.

00:12:44.811 --> 00:12:47.513
You stay out of this. You got that?

00:12:47.513 --> 00:12:51.284
Can't do. This is a
legitimate case of kidnapping.

00:12:51.284 --> 00:12:52.911
Please.

00:12:55.955 --> 00:12:57.786
All right.

00:12:58.624 --> 00:13:01.115
I'm coming, Tenchi.

00:13:03.596 --> 00:13:05.531
Here you come, Ryoko.

00:13:05.531 --> 00:13:08.267
Now, fire, Ryo-Ohki!

00:13:08.267 --> 00:13:11.293
What's wrong, Ryo-Ohki? I said fire!

00:13:13.005 --> 00:13:15.166
Ken-Ohki, fire!

00:13:20.513 --> 00:13:22.242
No choice!

00:13:29.455 --> 00:13:31.757
That's incredible!

00:13:31.757 --> 00:13:35.784
Damn! Ryo-Ohki, what are
you waiting for? Shoot back.

00:13:36.896 --> 00:13:40.433
Being in love with a guy
has made you soft, huh?

00:13:40.433 --> 00:13:41.923
Ryo-Ohki!

00:13:42.435 --> 00:13:45.233
Okay, Ken-Ohki! Finish her!

00:13:47.006 --> 00:13:48.473
What?

00:13:51.444 --> 00:13:53.674
What's the matter, Ken-Ohki?

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.156
It stopped firing?

00:14:03.156 --> 00:14:06.922
What the heck is happening?

00:14:08.261 --> 00:14:11.731
Ken-Ohki is somehow
not listening to my order.

00:14:11.731 --> 00:14:13.499
Yours as well, right?

00:14:13.499 --> 00:14:14.934
Yup.

00:14:14.934 --> 00:14:16.435
Just as I thought.

00:14:16.435 --> 00:14:19.639
I guess we'll just have to
settle the matter ourselves.

00:14:19.639 --> 00:14:22.041
Fine with me. Where shall we do it?

00:14:22.041 --> 00:14:25.169
I'll prepare a spot for you.

00:14:36.722 --> 00:14:38.724
How's that?

00:14:38.724 --> 00:14:41.192
Nice ambiance, isn't it?

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:46.465
You are enjoying this, aren't you, Washu?

00:14:46.465 --> 00:14:48.126
Yeah!

00:15:02.615 --> 00:15:05.743
- She's here!
- Eek! What am I gonna do?

00:15:17.163 --> 00:15:19.165
Where is Tenchi?

00:15:19.165 --> 00:15:21.656
Don't worry. He's right here.

00:15:24.937 --> 00:15:26.539
Tenchi!

00:15:26.539 --> 00:15:30.305
If you win, I'll give him
back to you. Fair enough?

00:15:31.644 --> 00:15:33.111
Fine.

00:15:37.416 --> 00:15:38.884
Ryoko.

00:15:38.884 --> 00:15:43.150
Ryoko, I do not care
if you die, but do not lose.

00:16:22.161 --> 00:16:23.651
Amazing!

00:16:45.151 --> 00:16:46.852
The game is over, Ryoko!

00:16:46.852 --> 00:16:47.953
Damn!

00:16:47.953 --> 00:16:49.488
Bye, Ryoko!

00:16:49.488 --> 00:16:51.691
Now, Tenchi. Let me get you out of there.

00:16:51.691 --> 00:16:55.525
Do not mind about Ryoko.
I will get you out of this mess.

00:16:56.362 --> 00:16:59.263
What do you think you're doing?

00:16:59.865 --> 00:17:03.836
Excuse us, Ryoko.
I know you're a little busy,

00:17:03.836 --> 00:17:07.473
but I hope you will wish
us good luck, won't you?

00:17:07.473 --> 00:17:09.809
Ayeka, you're just unbelievable!

00:17:09.809 --> 00:17:12.445
Your death will not be in vain.

00:17:12.445 --> 00:17:14.447
Well, please excuse us now.

00:17:14.447 --> 00:17:16.039
Wait a minute!

00:17:37.036 --> 00:17:39.163
We did it!

00:18:01.894 --> 00:18:05.798
Just as we had planned in advance.

00:18:05.798 --> 00:18:08.528
Our friendship has brought us this victory.

00:18:13.139 --> 00:18:14.607
This can't be true.

00:18:14.607 --> 00:18:16.302
It isn't.

00:18:17.543 --> 00:18:19.670
Let's see.

00:18:24.717 --> 00:18:27.709
Okay, you won. Kill me then.

00:18:29.321 --> 00:18:32.119
Hey, as you wish.

00:18:44.103 --> 00:18:46.071
Ryo-Ohki.

00:19:00.219 --> 00:19:02.346
All right.

00:19:04.023 --> 00:19:07.117
Leave before I change my mind.

00:19:08.427 --> 00:19:10.262
You'll regret this.

00:19:10.262 --> 00:19:15.825
No, I've never regretted
anything I did, in my entire life.

00:19:30.282 --> 00:19:32.307
Let's go, Ken-Ohki.

00:19:56.141 --> 00:20:00.579
Nagi was just as strong as I had heard.

00:20:00.579 --> 00:20:03.349
If Ayeka hadn't interfered
for her own selfish reasons,

00:20:03.349 --> 00:20:05.249
Nagi would have won.

00:20:07.486 --> 00:20:11.354
Could it be that Ryo-Ohki likes Ken-Ohki?

00:20:12.224 --> 00:20:19.130
What? Seriously? No, I can't
allow that! Just forget it!

00:20:20.099 --> 00:20:27.006
Get over him. You can find a much
better guy than that in this universe.

00:20:27.006 --> 00:20:30.843
Is Ryo-Ohki a girl?

00:20:30.843 --> 00:20:33.345
Like you didn't know?

00:20:33.345 --> 00:20:35.347
Where is Tenchi?

00:20:35.347 --> 00:20:37.611
I almost forgot about him. Tenchi!

00:20:42.288 --> 00:20:44.490
Are you all right, Tenchi?

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:46.926
Thank you, Sasami.

00:20:46.926 --> 00:20:48.761
Sasami got to him first.

00:20:48.761 --> 00:20:50.626
That should have been me.

00:22:55.654 --> 00:22:57.189
Well, thank you all for waiting.

00:22:57.189 --> 00:22:59.024
Now we'll present
Tenchi Muyo's special events

00:22:59.024 --> 00:23:01.093
with utmost confidence in success.

00:23:01.093 --> 00:23:04.396
Washu's dimensional
controller goes totally out of control.

00:23:04.396 --> 00:23:11.103
Blasted into random time and space
our destiny is blown in the wind.

00:23:11.103 --> 00:23:16.008
The wheel of fortune is ever in motion.
It's a stupendously fantastic story.

00:23:16.008 --> 00:23:19.311
Next episode is:
"Time and Space Adventures Part I."

00:23:19.311 --> 00:23:21.939
It's unquestionably fantastic!
